        # If payer not in participants, then all participants owe base, and remainder ...
        # Spec says leftover borne by payer. Payer pays the remainder (in addition to their own
        # share if participating). Simplest consistent interpretation:
        # - If payer is a participant: payer's own share = total_cents - base_cents*(n-1)
        #   which equals base_cents + remainder.
        # - If payer is not a participant: payer paid total, owes 0; participants each owe base;
        #   remainder is absorbed by payer (a small extra cost to payer) -> participants still owe base.
        # Either way participants other than payer each owe exactly base_cents.

        # Payer is credited with total amount paid.
